      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note: If we\u0027re allowing the option to fallback to importing using an external format even *if* a VkFormat is provided, then I believe we should make that decision here in `GetVulkanBackendFormat` as opposed to within `make_vk_backend_texture`. \n\nTheoretically, the client should only really be using the former to plug that information into the latter, but it would be odd to later assign the backend format to be VK_FORMAT_UNDEFINED if it was initially created with a valid VkFormat that we are just choosing not to use. We pass in the `GrBackendFormat` to `make_vk_backend_texture` as `const` anyhow, and I think it should stay that way.",
